{
    "name": "secrets",
    "title": "Secrets",
    "description": "Secrets: API keys and tokens that Pi uses without seeing them. The owner keeps them in Menu → Secrets; a bash command that names one ($NPM_TOKEN) runs with its value, and output that shows a value shows [secret NPM_TOKEN] instead. Pi can list them, ask the owner for one on a card with a hidden field, and keep a command's output as one.",
